msgstr "默认受保护。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "the locations below do not exist on this screen until the Pro add-on is installed and activated."
msgstr "下列位置在安装并启用 Pro 插件前不会出现在界面上。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "wp pnmf stats / hash-build / dupe-scan / usage-scan"
msgstr "wp pnmf stats / hash-build / dupe-scan / usage-scan"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "“Find duplicates” → tick the copies to delete → “Clean up duplicates”. One copy per group is always kept; runs in batches with a progress bar and a Stop button."
msgstr "「查找重复文件」→ 勾选要删除的副本 →「清理重复文件」。每组一定留一份；分批执行并显示进度与停止按钮。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "“Find folder…” box on the left panel. Type to jump straight to a folder."
msgstr "左侧面板的「搜索文件夹…」框，输入即可跳到该文件夹。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "“Missing alt” → “Fill with AI”; bulk bar → “AI tags” / “AI folders”. API key: “AI settings” in the toolbar."
msgstr "「待补 Alt」→「用 AI 填写」；批量栏「AI 标签」／「AI 文件夹」。密钥填在工具栏的「AI 设置」。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "%1$d / %2$d hashed"
msgstr "已计算 %1$d / %2$d"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Hashing stopped."
msgstr "已停止计算哈希。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Hashing stopped — %d files are still unhashed. Run it again to continue."
msgstr "已停止——还有 %d 个文件未计算哈希，再执行一次即可继续。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The server did not answer in time. The work may still be running — try again, or lower the batch size."
msgstr "服务器没有及时响应，工作可能仍在进行——请再试一次，或降低批次大小。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Hashing is still running. Stop it and close?"
msgstr "哈希计算仍在进行，要停止并关闭吗？"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Hashing stopped unexpectedly — try running it again."
msgstr "哈希计算意外中止——请再执行一次。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Hashing stopped: %1$d files could not be saved to the database (IDs: %2$s). Check database write permissions, or disable the object cache and try again."
msgstr "哈希停止：有 %1$d 个文件写不进数据库（ID：%2$s）。请检查数据库写入权限，或先停用对象缓存再试。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Hashing stopped: %1$d files keep failing (IDs: %2$s). They may be missing from disk, unreadable, or have duplicate meta rows."
msgstr "哈希停止：有 %1$d 个文件一直失败（ID：%2$s）。可能文件不在磁盘上、读不到，或有重复的元数据行。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "%1$d files could not be saved to the database (IDs: %2$s). The rest were hashed."
msgstr "有 %1$d 个文件写不进数据库（ID：%2$s），其余已计算完成。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "%1$d files could not be hashed (IDs: %2$s). The rest were hashed; these were skipped so the run could finish."
msgstr "有 %1$d 个文件无法计算哈希（ID：%2$s）。其余已完成，这些文件已被跳过，避免整批卡住。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The mail server said: %s"
msgstr "邮件服务器回报：%s"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The report email could not be sent."
msgstr "报告邮件无法发出。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Most hosts block PHP mail(); install an SMTP plugin (WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP) and send a test from there. The report itself is generated correctly."
msgstr "多数主机禁用 PHP mail()。请安装 SMTP 插件（WP Mail SMTP、FluentSMTP）并先发测试邮件；报告内容本身是正常生成的。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "From: %1$s → To: %2$s."
msgstr "发件人：%1$s → 收件人：%2$s。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The last sending attempt failed."
msgstr "上一次发送失败。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP's last failed log says: %s"
msgstr "FluentSMTP 最近一条失败记录：%s"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP is installed but has no connection configured yet: finish its setup (provider + sender) and send a test email there first."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 已安装但尚未建立连接：请先完成设置（服务商＋发件人），并在 FluentSMTP 内发一封测试邮件。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP is configured — check FluentSMTP → Email Logs; the sender address usually has to match the authenticated domain."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 已设置——请看 FluentSMTP → Email Logs；发件人地址通常必须与验证的域名一致。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "WP Mail SMTP is installed — run its “Email Test” to see the provider error, and make sure the From address uses your domain."
msgstr "已安装 WP Mail SMTP——请用它内置的「Email Test」看服务商错误，并确认发件人使用你的域名。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "No SMTP plugin detected: WordPress falls back to PHP mail(), which most hosts block. Install FluentSMTP or WP Mail SMTP and send a test email there first."
msgstr "未检测到 SMTP 插件：WordPress 会退回 PHP mail()，多数主机都封锁。请安装 FluentSMTP 或 WP Mail SMTP，并先在那里发测试邮件。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Sender: %1$s → Recipient: %2$s"
msgstr "发件人：%1$s → 收件人：%2$s"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "(not set)"
msgstr "（未设置）"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP is set to read the %s OAuth keys from wp-config.php, but the constants are missing — the Client ID therefore reaches the provider empty and the request is rejected. Declare FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID and FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET in wp-config.php, or switch that connection to “database” in FluentSMTP and paste the keys there, then reconnect."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 设定成从 wp-config.php 读取 %s 的 OAuth 密钥，但常量没有定义——送到服务商的 Client ID 因此是空的，请求被拒。请在 wp-config.php 声明 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID 与 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET，或在 FluentSMTP 把该连接改成“数据库”并直接填入密钥，然后重新连接。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP has no OAuth Client ID for this %s connection. Paste the Client ID and Secret from Google Cloud Console (OAuth client of type “Web application”) into FluentSMTP, then click “Connect to Google” again."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 的这个 %s 连接没有 OAuth Client ID。请把 Google Cloud Console 的 Client ID 与 Secret（OAuth 客户端类型选“Web 应用”）贴进 FluentSMTP，再点一次“Connect to Google”。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The %s OAuth keys exist, but the authorisation is no longer valid (the refresh token was revoked or expired). In FluentSMTP remove that connection and add it again, completing the consent screen — this also refreshes the token."
msgstr "%s 的 OAuth 密钥存在，但授权已失效（refresh token 被撤销或过期）。请在 FluentSMTP 删除该连接并重新添加，走完同意画面——这会同时更新 token。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP has no sender address on the default connection — set “From Email” there; most providers reject mail without a verified sender."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 的默认连接没有发件人地址——请在该连接设置“From Email”；多数服务商会拒收没有验证发件人的邮件。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The provider rejected the request because no OAuth Client ID was sent. Check the SMTP plugin's connection settings and reconnect the account."
msgstr "服务商因为没有发送 OAuth Client ID 而拒绝请求。请检查 SMTP 插件的连接设置并重新连接账号。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Mail transport: an SMTP plugin is active, but its connection settings could not be read."
msgstr "发信方式：检测到 SMTP 插件，但读不到它的连接设置。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Mail transport: PHP mail() — no SMTP plugin is active, so most hosts will refuse to deliver."
msgstr "发信方式：PHP mail()——没有启用 SMTP 插件，多数主机不会投递。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "OAuth keys from wp-config.php"
msgstr "OAuth 密钥来自 wp-config.php"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "wp-config.php keys are missing"
msgstr "wp-config.php 的常量未定义"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "OAuth keys stored in the database"
msgstr "OAuth 密钥存在数据库"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "OAuth Client ID is empty"
msgstr "OAuth Client ID 是空的"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Mail transport: FluentSMTP — %s"
msgstr "发信方式：FluentSMTP — %s"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "sender %s"
msgstr "发件人 %s"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "sender not set"
msgstr "发件人未设置"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Sender:"
msgstr "发件人："

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Recipient:"
msgstr "收件人："

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The %s Client ID never reaches the provider: FluentSMTP is set to read it from wp-config.php and that constant is missing or empty. Declare FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID and FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET there, or switch the connection to “database” in FluentSMTP and paste the keys in the form, then reconnect."
msgstr "%s 的 Client ID 根本没有送到服务商：FluentSMTP 设定成从 wp-config.php 读取，而那个常量不存在或是空的。请在该文件声明 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID 与 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET，或在 FluentSMTP 把连接改成“数据库”并在表单填入密钥，然后重新连接。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The provider received no Client ID even though this %s connection has one stored — the value is stale, or a different connection handles this email. Open the connection in FluentSMTP, paste the Application Client ID and Secret again, save, then click “Connect to Google”."
msgstr "服务商没有收到 Client ID，但这条 %s 连接里明明存了——可能那个值是旧的，或这封信其实走了另一条连接。请在 FluentSMTP 打开该连接，重新贴上 Application Client ID 与 Secret，保存后点“Connect to Google”。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The %s OAuth keys exist, but the authorisation was revoked or expired. In FluentSMTP remove that connection and add it again, completing the consent screen. If the Google consent screen is still in “Testing”, Google expires refresh tokens after 7 days — publish the app to stop re-authorising every week."
msgstr "%s 的 OAuth 密钥存在，但授权已被撤销或过期。请在 FluentSMTP 删除该连接并重新添加，走完同意画面。若 Google 的同意画面还在“测试”状态，refresh token 每 7 天就会失效——把应用发布上线就不必每周重新授权。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The %s connection looks configured, but the provider still refused the message — open FluentSMTP → Email Logs for its full response."
msgstr "%s 连接看起来已设置完成，但服务商仍拒收——请打开 FluentSMTP → Email Logs 看完整回应。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The Client Secret is empty on this %1$s connection (OAuth client %2$s), so Google rejects the token refresh — every email through this connection fails, not just this report. Open Google Cloud Console → Credentials → that OAuth client, copy the Client Secret, paste it into FluentSMTP, save, then click “Connect to Google”."
msgstr "这条 %1$s 连接的 Client Secret 是空的（OAuth 客户端 %2$s），所以 Google 会拒绝更新令牌——这条连接发出的所有邮件都会失败，不只本报告。请到 Google Cloud Console → Credentials 找到该 OAuth 客户端，复制 Client Secret，贴回 FluentSMTP 保存，然后点“Connect to Google”。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The stored access token expired on %s."
msgstr "已保存的访问令牌已于 %s 过期。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Client Secret is empty"
msgstr "Client Secret 是空的"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The %s Client ID never reaches the provider: the connection is set to “Store in wp-config.php” and that constant is missing or empty — the two key fields are only shown when the connection is set to “Store in Database”. Switch it back to “Store in Database” and paste the Client ID and Secret there (or declare FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID and FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET in wp-config.php), then reconnect."
msgstr "%s 的 Client ID 没有送到服务商：连接被设成“Store in wp-config.php”，而该常量不存在或是空的——那两个密钥字段只有在“Store in Database”模式下才会显示。请切回“Store in Database”并在那里贴上 Client ID 与 Secret（或在 wp-config.php 声明 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID 与 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET），然后重新连接。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP is set to read the %s OAuth keys from wp-config.php, but the constants are missing — so the Client ID reaches the provider empty. Either declare FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID and FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET in wp-config.php, or switch the connection to “Store in Database” (the two key fields only appear in that mode) and paste the keys there, then reconnect."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 设定成从 wp-config.php 读取 %s 的 OAuth 密钥，但常量不存在——所以送出的 Client ID 是空的。请在 wp-config.php 声明 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID 与 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET，或把连接改成“Store in Database”（两个密钥字段只在该模式出现）并贴上密钥，然后重新连接。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The saved error message was cleared."
msgstr "已清除保存的错误信息。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Dismiss this message"
msgstr "清除这条信息"


