msgid "AI stopped unexpectedly — try again."
msgstr "AI 意外中止——请再试一次。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "AI stopped — %1$d of %2$d fields were filled before you cancelled."
msgstr "已停止——在你取消前已填写 %1$d / %2$d 个字段。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "AI is still filling fields. Stop it and close?"
msgstr "AI 仍在填写字段，要停止并关闭吗？"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Quality: full vision models (gpt-4o, gemini-2.0-flash) describe images noticeably better than the mini models. DeepSeek cannot read images, so its alt text is guesswork — use it only for tags."
msgstr "质量：完整视觉模型（gpt-4o、gemini-2.0-flash）的描述明显比 mini 系列好。DeepSeek 不能读图片，用它生成的 alt 文字只是猜测——建议只用在标签。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Write the alt text in %s."
msgstr "请用%s撰写这段替代文字。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The image could not be prepared for AI."
msgstr "图片无法处理成可发送的格式。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "API base URL (optional)"
msgstr "API 端点网址（选填）"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Leave empty for the official endpoint. If your server cannot reach the provider (common on mainland-China hosting), put a reachable OpenAI-compatible endpoint here — it will be used for this site only."
msgstr "留空使用官方端点。若你的主机连不到服务商（中国大陆主机常见），可填入一个可连接、兼容 OpenAI 的端点——只影响本站。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "AI request failed: %s"
msgstr "AI 请求失败：%s"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The AI provider did not answer in time. Check the API base URL and that your server can reach it."
msgstr "AI 服务商没有及时响应。请检查 API 端点网址，并确认服务器能连上它。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Every image in the batch failed — check the API key and base URL."
msgstr "这批每一张都失败——请检查 API key 与端点网址。"

